'''Smelling salts''' is an item that can be obtained from the [[Supplies (Tombs of Amascut)|supplies bag]] within the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It starts with 2 uses.

Crushing it will repeatedly restore run energy by 25% and boost the player's combat stats every 15 seconds over the course of 8 minutes, akin to an [[Overload]], though without drawbacks.

==Effects==
[[Attack]], [[Strength]], [[Defence]], [[Ranged]], and [[Magic]] boosts are calculated with: <math>\lfloor BaseLevel \times \frac{16}{100} \rfloor + 11</math>

